UID:2d26878833b56faa3aa3dfefd7c73a98@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:@apsobersocials Please join us for our last Center Stage open 
 mic summer series happening on Thursday\, August 27th at @thecenterinasbur
 ypark Doors 7 PM First feature goes on at 7:45 Open mic sign up to follow 
 till 10 Our features for August are @cjcicio \, @caitlinmcgarry11 \, @nusp
 ace5000 &amp\; @mymattisname giving us a mix of music and poetry Please en
 ter the West entrance of The Center (door on the right if you are standing
  in front of building on 3rd Ave). Security will be working 24/7 to assist
  with entry. You will then see arrows directing you through the building t
 o get to the outside garden area This is also our LAST official AP Sober S
 ocials event on the calendar (for now) so come out and support local music
 ians and poets in an awesome outdoor space! Please BYO comfy chair\, beach
  chair\, blanket etc.\, snacks or beverages. We will also have light optio
 ns available. If the weather is bad\, we will move this inside so we hope 
 to see you\, rain or shine **Friendly reminder: You do not need to be acti
 vely practicing sobriety or be in recovery to take part in any of our even
 ts or activities. We just ask that you please be respectful for those that
  are. In addition\, we do not tolerate any form of racism\, sexism\, homop
 hobia\, transphobia\, Islamophobia\, antisemitism or hate against oppresse
 d or marginalized groups. We are dedicated to uplifting\, centering and pr
 otecting vulnerable people. THANK YOU** THEME: OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: A
 sbury Park Sober Socials &amp\; The Center FEATURES: Matt Bailey\, Space\,
  Caitlin McGarry &amp\; Chris Cicio PRICE: FREE CONTACT: @apsobersocials
