BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LetItFlow Open Mic
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260902T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260902T220000
UID:0e690c5e88d3c596501aca10da256709@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: Let It Flow at the House of Playokee Date: Sept
  2\, 2026 Start/End Time: 6:30 pm Address: 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union\, N
 J Theme: Open Mic and features Host: Elijah Brown Feature(s): TBA Price: $
 20 Advance Tickets / $25 At Door - CashApp - $Elijahbr85 / Venmo - @Elijah
 br1985 / PAYPAL @ElijahBr0wn Phone: TEXT (862) 306-1758 Email Address: &nb
 sp\; lifpublishing@gmail.com Website: Social Media: &nbsp\; @elijahbr85 Ev
 ent Description: &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Support doesn’t always mean buying a tick
 et. As I prepare to celebrate 21 years of hosting the Let It Flow Poetry S
 eries\, I know everyone won’t be able to attend\, and that’s okay. The
 re are still so many ways you can help make this celebration special. You 
 can: Purchase a ticket. Share or repost the flyer. Tag someone who loves l
 ive entertainment. Sponsor a ticket for someone who may not be able to aff
 ord to attend. Leave a comment about your Let It Flow experience if you’
 ve ever been to one of our shows. If you’ve never experienced Let It Flo
 w\, this is the perfect time. It’s more than poetry. It’s laughter\, s
 torytelling\, live performances\, community\, and moments that stay with y
 ou long after the show ends. Whether you’re planning a girls’ night ou
 t\, a date night\, or just looking for something different\, you’ll leav
 e with something to talk about. And I’ll make you this promise… If you
  come to the show and honestly don’t enjoy yourself\, I’ll personally 
 refund your ticket. That’s how much I believe in what we’ve built over
  the last 21 years. Thank you to everyone who’s supported this journey. 
 Whether you’re in the room\, sharing the event\, or cheering from afar\,
  you’ve been part of this legacy. Come Let It Flow.
LOCATION:House of Playokee\, 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union NJ\, Union\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/letitflow-open-mic-2-2
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
