BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LetItFlow Open Mic
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T220000
UID:580cc27cbbe9b4dc31d84f706e695e3a@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: Let It Flow at the House of Playokee Date: Nov 
 4\, 2026 Start/End Time: 6:30 pm Address: 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union\, NJ
  Theme: Open Mic and features Host: Elijah Brown Feature(s): TBA Price: $2
 0 Advance Tickets / $25 At Door - CashApp - $Elijahbr85 / Venmo - @Elijahb
 r1985 / PAYPAL @ElijahBr0wn Phone: TEXT (862) 306-1758 Email Address: &nbs
 p\; lifpublishing@gmail.com Website: Social Media: &nbsp\; @elijahbr85 Eve
 nt Description: &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Support doesn’t always mean buying a ticke
 t. As I prepare to celebrate 21 years of hosting the Let It Flow Poetry Se
 ries\, I know everyone won’t be able to attend\, and that’s okay. Ther
 e are still so many ways you can help make this celebration special. You c
 an: Purchase a ticket. Share or repost the flyer. Tag someone who loves li
 ve entertainment. Sponsor a ticket for someone who may not be able to affo
 rd to attend. Leave a comment about your Let It Flow experience if you’v
 e ever been to one of our shows. If you’ve never experienced Let It Flow
 \, this is the perfect time. It’s more than poetry. It’s laughter\, st
 orytelling\, live performances\, community\, and moments that stay with yo
 u long after the show ends. Whether you’re planning a girls’ night out
 \, a date night\, or just looking for something different\, you’ll leave
  with something to talk about. And I’ll make you this promise… If you 
 come to the show and honestly don’t enjoy yourself\, I’ll personally r
 efund your ticket. That’s how much I believe in what we’ve built over 
 the last 21 years. Thank you to everyone who’s supported this journey. W
 hether you’re in the room\, sharing the event\, or cheering from afar\, 
 you’ve been part of this legacy. Come Let It Flow.
LOCATION:House of Playokee\, 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union NJ\, Union\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/letitflow-open-mic-nov
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
